    *a temporal specification* has the instant *a date*.
    *a temporal specification* has the duration *a duration*.
    *a temporal specification* has the frequency *a duration*.
    *a temporal specification* has the number of repetitions *a number*.
    *a temporal specification* has the temporal label *a text*.
    *a temporal specification* is timed after *a second temporal specification*.
    *a temporal specification* is timed before *a second temporal specification*.
    *a temporal specification* is timed immediately after *a second temporal specification*.
    *a temporal specification* is timed immediately before *a second temporal specification*.
